As @John Hughes pointed out,
since $\overrightarrow{AO}$
is expected to be just the direction vector,
the expression \eqref{2}
can be simplified:
\begin{align}
\overrightarrow{AO}
&=
\|\overrightarrow{AC}\|\cdot\overrightarrow{AB}
+\|\overrightarrow{AB}\|\cdot\overrightarrow{AC}
.
\end{align}

